{"id":"g5cb8p7fr1dhlouhmbv1rat5a","title":"Uber 将全部 30,000 名员工接入 ChatGPT Work","originalTitle":"Uber puts all 30,000 employees on ChatGPT Work","summary":"Uber 与 OpenAI 宣布扩大合作，Uber 全球约 30,000 名员工都将使用 ChatGPT Work。此前 Uber 今年早些时候先在 1,000 名员工中试点，其中约 80% 为非工程师，用于分析运营数据、本地化培训材料和搭建个性化仪表盘等任务。Uber 未披露此次推广的支出，表示将跟踪员工的使用方式和工作流来指导后续 AI 部署；OpenAI 与 Uber 密切合作完成了集成。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"TechCrunch · AI"},"links":{"original":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/uber-puts-all-30000-employees-on-chatgpt-work/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-22T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-23T02:31:49.150Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-23T02:31:49.150Z","category":"industry","tags":["行业动态","OpenAI"],"score":58,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b6ea2e81-0ce5-4e33-b913-d6c262b6efd0","title":"Uber全员部署ChatGPT Work"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Lucas Ropek","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b6ea2e81-0ce5-4e33-b913-d6c262b6efd0","title":"Uber全员部署ChatGPT Work"}],"topics":[{"slug":"openai","name":"OpenAI / ChatGPT"},{"slug":"industry","name":"行业动态"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fh2eTDSFpQwA","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}